{"3886700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starlight, Inc", "steam_appid": 3886700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/44f7ba30295ea2eca9adcd41b4a9a538.avif?t=1775696843\" width=784 height=236 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/37fee37f6b66ea8c7696cd06dd0b9fd7.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On entering your local Starlight megastore in the hope of getting a midnight snack, a horrifying star-shaped parasite suddenly attacks you, replacing your head with... <strong>itself.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can even calm down, you look back and realize <strong>the entrance has vanished. </strong><br>You are not alone in here, and the exit has yet to be found. Investigate alone or with up to <strong>8 friends</strong> as you explore, collect, build, and survive against the monstrosities roaming this ever-changing dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb705a58d15e96570c075f65f708b5ca.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When lights are on, the store seems suspiciously calm... make the most of it by gathering a wide variety of atypical store provisions to survive starvation until you escape and stock up on any other useful resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the store closes, the monstrous employees clock in. <strong>The night shift begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let hunger consume you before the monsters do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/4cd649f7fc59fdd1be4421509c802bae.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself from various abominations by<strong> </strong>setting up fortifications before nightfall. <br><strong>Build a base to your taste using the physics based construction system and its dynamic environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb404b16aef114d701223bb18e769711.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, a blood moon rises… <strong>it's time to run to the pharmacy</strong>, the only safe place in this store where a handful of employees have managed to keep their humanity, all thanks to the pharmacist. Beneath her eccentric personality hides a complete genius in dozens of fields: medicine crafting, robotics, interdimensional studies… <br>You are now an employee of Starlight, Inc! Fulfill missions from the remaining staff, buy upgrades from the pharmacist and most importantly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>find a way out of this never-ending liminal torment.</strong>       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/44f7ba30295ea2eca9adcd41b4a9a538.avif?t=1775696843\" width=784 height=236 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/37fee37f6b66ea8c7696cd06dd0b9fd7.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On entering your local Starlight megastore in the hope of getting a midnight snack, a horrifying star-shaped parasite suddenly attacks you, replacing your head with... <strong>itself.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you can even calm down, you look back and realize <strong>the entrance has vanished. </strong><br>You are not alone in here, and the exit has yet to be found. Investigate alone or with up to <strong>8 friends</strong> as you explore, collect, build, and survive against the monstrosities roaming this ever-changing dimension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/d3a627d74429947bca0d4cb3a2487b03.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb705a58d15e96570c075f65f708b5ca.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When lights are on, the store seems suspiciously calm... make the most of it by gathering a wide variety of atypical store provisions to survive starvation until you escape and stock up on any other useful resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the store closes, the monstrous employees clock in. <strong>The night shift begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you let hunger consume you before the monsters do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/9d93579a6010565426daacee71b4af65.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/4cd649f7fc59fdd1be4421509c802bae.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend yourself from various abominations by<strong> </strong>setting up fortifications before nightfall. <br><strong>Build a base to your taste using the physics based construction system and its dynamic environment.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/685b879b0d0c075ed379951d60677a14.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/cb404b16aef114d701223bb18e769711.avif?t=1775696843\" width=1560 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, a blood moon rises… <strong>it's time to run to the pharmacy</strong>, the only safe place in this store where a handful of employees have managed to keep their humanity, all thanks to the pharmacist. Beneath her eccentric personality hides a complete genius in dozens of fields: medicine crafting, robotics, interdimensional studies… <br>You are now an employee of Starlight, Inc! Fulfill missions from the remaining staff, buy upgrades from the pharmacist and most importantly... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>find a way out of this never-ending liminal torment.</strong>       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">                           </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.poster.avif?t=1775696843\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.webm?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/extras/ba05989da1ded0aa6a3122e1acef48b1.mp4?t=1775696843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A late-night snack turns into a nightmare. Starlight, Inc is an online co-op survival horror game set in a creepy ever-changing megastore. Explore, collect, build and survive with up to 8 friends in hope of finding a way out this dimension. Will you let hunger consume you before the monsters do?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/58ce0b3f8a1b8a8196163e77eddfaa503b16990d/header.jpg?t=1775696843", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/4164db510f86163cb6bd236a6e5465ee25c8b109/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775696843", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886700/4164db510f86163cb6bd236a6e5465ee25c8b109/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775696843", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 1703 (Creators Update)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<b